logs/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Client material — never publish. Pipeline runs contain the client's requirements and the
# generated solution; input/ holds their Functional Designs. Both were previously only
# UNTRACKED, so a single `git add -A` would have committed a client document. Ignore the
# folders and allow-list the two bundled examples that ship with the tool.
output/
input/*
!input/Smart Search FD.md
!input/Supplier PO Status Viewer FD.md

# Public Cloud Brain — never publish. brain/sharepoint/raw/ holds the harvested
# CLIENT documents; chunks/ holds masked derivatives; index/ holds the embeddings;
# plus ingest logs and the SharePoint OAuth token cache. All runtime-generated and/or
# client-derived. (The public SAP scope catalog lives in mcp-server/catalog/, tracked.)
brain/
node_modules/
*.code-workspace
webapp/data/btp-connection.json
webapp/data/btp-connections.json
mcp-server/logs/
mcp-server/vector/index.json
mcp-server/vector/index.npy
mcp-server/graph/graph.json
mcp-server/catalog/catalog.db
*.pyc
.env
*.pem
*.key
lambda/build/
